{"synopsis":"Siswa SMA Li Huowang memiliki kemampuan: setiap kali ia menutup matanya, ia memasuki dunia kultivasi yang aneh. Di dunia aneh itu, ia ditangkap oleh seseorang yang memanggilnya “Guru” dan dijadikan obat hidup—kuali manusia yang dapat diubah menjadi pil kapan saja.\n\nNamun, di dunia nyata, Li Huowang adalah pasien gangguan mental yang tinggal di rumah sakit jiwa dan tidak dapat bersekolah. Dokter mengatakan kepadanya bahwa dunia kultivasi yang aneh itu hanyalah halusinasi.\n\nKini, terhimpit antara kenyataan dan ilusi, kebenaran dan kebohongan, Li Huowang pun tak kuasa menahan tangis dan berteriak:\n\n“Bu, aku benar-benar tak bisa membedakan mana yang nyata!”","alternative_title":"道诡异仙","author":"阅文漫画, Foxtail Quill","artist":"]阅文漫画","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"f0c42ebd-eea4-44e0-8dde-c63b91dc8586","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e344ba77-0dd2-46d6-82f6-d53161d413d4","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1c97bc09-9a6a-4ddc-9218-2c466c6f1701","number":"88","chapter":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ae73d495-9146-4a8d-a0cc-4bbdfffb895d","number":"87","chapter":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-06-21","released":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c7a6ff31-8b70-4ba3-911a-76fa1d0d9d60","number":"86","chapter":"86","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-06-21","released":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"77dac644-6478-4ad6-996e-22a3d064956f","number":"85","chapter":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-06-08","released":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"82121073-27b0-43f2-a881-607ea7e4fd05","number":"84","chapter":"84","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-05-26","released":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"658daece-fb39-485b-bb50-a504608ec113","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"Chapter 83","date":"